[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10023.11, "timestamp": "02:47:03", "text": "但从某种意义上说，这与……相矛盾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10027.59, "timestamp": "02:47:07", "text": "视频。呃，我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10030.389, "timestamp": "02:47:10", "text": "基本上，这是一个重播爱情剧的频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10033.03, "timestamp": "02:47:13", "text": "所以，我不知道我是否应该把这个放上去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10036.469, "timestamp": "02:47:16", "text": "部分。我不知道。但没关系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10039.19, "timestamp": "02:47:19", "text": "因为我注意到很多人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10043.03, "timestamp": "02:47:23", "text": "我的社区里有些人错过了某些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10045.67, "timestamp": "02:47:25", "text": "流。有些东西他们看不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10048.79, "timestamp": "02:47:28", "text": "每个人对亚马逊的评价都不一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10052.309, "timestamp": "02:47:32", "text": "今年4月（2026年），我也会搬到那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10055.51, "timestamp": "02:47:35", "text": "日本。所以他是一位企业家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10057.429, "timestamp": "02:47:37", "text": "好的。这将是我的主要原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10060.15, "timestamp": "02:47:40", "text": "让战争频道看起来不像战争"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10062.71, "timestamp": "02:47:42", "text": "24小时频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10066.63, "timestamp": "02:47:46", "text": "希望我的家人不会那样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10070.63, "timestamp": "02:47:50", "text": "我家里的电脑出了点蠢问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10073.35, "timestamp": "02:47:53", "text": "你现在看到的这台电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10075.51, "timestamp": "02:47:55", "text": "[笑声] 好吧，但愿它能持续下去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10077.03, "timestamp": "02:47:57", "text": "一年。"}]